<!--
  fixture kind: real (as exported; only this provenance comment was added, so this file's
  sha256 differs from the upstream artifact's).
  source: skoba/openehr-templates-jp@09187226bd735246a36044597935b4c891a74c7b
          jp_referral.opt (sha256 99abe4e3e1e5a494805764f3565593b2a0d0482f619917266ab46a22d025c659),
          exported from the AD project jp_referral.t.json in the same commit
          (AD repository: openEHR-templates-jp, Better Archetype Designer)
  archetype ja translations: openehr-japanese-translation@e552c0a56f7bbee088eb46a1e9b04df074d16293 (Sprint A)
  version: jp_referral v0.2 (sem_ver 0.2.0, 2026-09-25). Replaces v0.1
           (openehr-templates-jp@8eebe04, sha256 99d474f8...; see git history of this file).
  diff v0.1 -> v0.2 (measured, docs/reports/referral-intake-log.md R10): 13 roots / 26 cards unchanged in
           count; +problem_diagnosis at0077 発症日時 (DV_DATE_TIME), +at0073 診断確度 (DV_CODED_TEXT,
           code_list at0074-at0076); at0002 gains the DV_CODED_TEXT alternative with the ICD-11
           referenceSetUri (value_set_binding; the only C_CODE_REFERENCE in the file, term_bindings 0);
           -person at0010 コメント (担当医), -organisation at0019 コメント (診療科); at0062 description
           extended (主訴を含めて記載); clinical_synopsis at0002 renamed per root
           (症状経過及び検査結果 / 治療経過) - NOTE the extractor still collapses the two into one label
           (openehr-ruby#58, see R10). Still absent: 処方 (medication_order), アレルギー, 患者 CLUSTER (v0.3).
  contract: docs/design/referral-v2-inventory.md v2.1; intake log docs/reports/referral-intake-log.md R4-
  versioning: file name fixed; each accepted version replaces this file, goldens are regenerated
           and the diff is recorded in the intake log (git history is the lineage).
-->
